  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>​​Size &amp; Fit\nSlim fit is tailored and sleek7/8 length hits at ankles\n\nProduct Features\nPremium Tech Fleece fabric for lightweight, smooth-on-both-sides comfort\nReflective Nike Futura logo and screen-printed Air Max graphics supply sleek heritage style\nArticulated paneling near the knees assists with free and easy movement\nDrawcord-adjustable elastic waistband for a personalized fit\nSide pockets and a zippered back pocket secure on-the-go essentials\nRibbed ankle cuffs rest above your shoes for a clean look\n53% cotton, 47% polyester\nMachine wash\nThe Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Jogger Pants are imported.\nGear up for your day in sportswear-meets-streetwear style and immaculate comfort in the Men's Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Jogger Pants. The lightweight and irresistibly smooth Tech Fleece wraps your lower body in dreamy comfort and warmth without weighing you down, while Tech taping, a reflective Futura logo, and Air Max graphics pop off the fabric. Plain and simple, these joggers are a cheat code in your wardrobe, with every detail culminating in a pair you can sport whether lounging around or stepping out in complete confidence.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Jogger Pants</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Neon Yellow</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>5141672</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Adult - Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 32.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 2.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 3.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36.2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-al